and programs that support student success in English, math. science and","x":384,"y":920,"w":1545,"h":44},{"text":"technology. It also preserves Outdoor Education for every fifth-grade student.","x":383,"y":983,"w":1620,"h":46},{"text":"Without Measure . Pacifica School District would have to reduce teachers.","x":382,"y":1047,"w":1584,"h":40},{"text":"librarians and critical educational programs.","x":383,"y":1111,"w":916,"h":44},{"text":"Measure continues Pacifica's tradition of supporting local schools with","x":382,"y":1204,"w":1508,"h":45},{"text":"funding that stays in our community and cannot be taken by the state or used","x":380,"y":1267,"w":1626,"h":48},{"text":"for administrators.","x":378,"y":1332,"w":380,"h":35},{"text":"Vote Yes on _ : Strong Schools Build Strong Communities","x":379,"y":1426,"w":1205,"h":45},{"text":"9","x":2229,"y":526,"w":35,"h":72},{"text":"•","x":455,"y":1721,"w":20,"h":23},{"text":"Attract and retain qualified teachers","x":523,"y":1520,"w":749,"h":45},{"text":"Enhance core academic programs","x":525,"y":1584,"w":722,"h":45},{"text":"Support struggling students","x":524,"y":1647,"w":577,"h":46},{"text":"Strengthen library services","x":524,"y":1711,"w":561,"h":45},{"text":"Maintain technology instruction","x":524,"y":1773,"w":649,"h":45},{"text":"Support outstanding art, music and electives critical to a well-rounded","x":524,"y":1836,"w":1459,"h":45},{"text":"education","x":523,"y":1901,"w":202,"h":36},{"text":"Measure _ Is Fiscally Accountable and Does Not Increase Taxes","x":377,"y":1991,"w":1361,"h":46},{"text":"• Every dollar stays in Pacifica schools and cannot be taken by the state","x":452,"y":2087,"w":1552,"h":47},{"text":"• No money can be used for administrators' salaries","x":452,"y":2152,"w":1123,"h":44},{"text":"• An inde.pendent Citizens' Oversight Committee has ensured responsible","x":452,"y":2214,"w":1583,"h":44},{"text":"spending for more than two decades","x":521,"y":2278,"w":768,"h":44},{"text":"• Homeowners age 65 and older remain eligible for an exemption","x":452,"y":2343,"w":1404,"h":44},{"text":"Our local elementary and middie schools are an integral part of our community.","x":374,"y":2433,"w":1659,"h":46},{"text":"Please join parents, teachers and community leaders in protecting quality","x":374,"y":2497,"w":1544,"h":46},{"text":"education, strengthening our community and investing in Pacifica's future. Vote","x":373,"y":2559,"w":1660,"h":46},{"text":"Yes on Measure","x":373,"y":2624,"w":342,"h":35},{"text":"z-","x":2125,"y":1335,"w":52,"h":46},{"text":"3","x":2097,"y":1657,"w":34,"h":47},{"text":"9","x":2076,"y":1968,"w":35,"h":58},{"text":"6","x":2120,"y":2297,"w":28,"h":46},{"text":"IO","x":2134,"y":2480,"w":48,"h":43},{"text":"3","x":2131,"y":2634,"w":52,"h":69}]}]}
